    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ SMART TRIGGER & OPTIMIZATION\n\n**What Happens:**\nThis section acts as the \"Wake Up & Check\" system, optimized to save resources.\n\n1. **Schedule:** Runs automatically every 10 minutes.\n2. **Resource Check:** Runs a lightweight SQL `COUNT(*)` query first.\n3. **Gatekeeper:** \n   - If Count = 0: The workflow **stops immediately**. No API calls are wasted.\n   - If Count > 0: It triggers the heavy `Fetch Active Alerts` query.\n4. **Routing:** The **Switch Node** separates alerts into two logical streams:\n   - **ABOVE:** For Breakout alerts (Price ≥ Target)\n   - **BELOW:** For Breakdown alerts (Price ≤ Target)\n\n**Output:** A clean list of active alerts, sorted by condition type.",
        "height": 590,
        "width": 1172,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -144,
        -496
      ],
      "id": "816c2856-9129-4c2e-b495-0c9e6dfa9bb3",
      "name": "Trigger Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔄 EXECUTION CORE (DUAL BRANCHES)\n\n**What Happens:**\nBoth branches (ABOVE & BELOW) function as independent processing engines.\n\n**The Execution Loop:**\n1. **Batching:** Processes alerts one-by-one (or in small batches) to ensure stability.\n2. **Authentication:** Generates a fresh TOTP and logs into AngelOne to get a session JWT.\n3. **Data Fusion:** The `Prepare JWT` node merges the Authentication Token with the Stock Token.\n4. **Live Data:** Fetches the **LTP (Last Traded Price)** directly from AngelOne API.\n\n**The Logic Check:**\n- **Upper Branch:** Checks if `LTP >= Target` (Crossed Up)\n- **Lower Branch:** Checks if `LTP <= Target` (Dropped Down)\n\n**Output:** Verified trigger events ready for notification.",
        "height": 1339,
        "width": 1497,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1056,
        -896
      ],
      "id": "38cebc17-b5b5-4f00-b065-714d63fac814",
      "name": "Core Logic Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📱 NOTIFICATION & CLEANUP\n\n**What Happens:**\nOnce an alert condition is met (True), this final stage executes the user interaction.\n\n1. **Telegram Notification:** \n   - Sends a rich-text message.\n   - Includes: Stock Name, Trigger Price, Current Price, and Direction (📈/📉).\n2. **Database Cleanup:** \n   - Immediately **DELETES** the alert from the `user_alerts` table.\n   - This prevents the user from being spammed every 10 minutes for the same event.\n\n**Result:** The user is notified instantly, and the system resets for the next cycle.",
        "height": 1344,
        "width": 596,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2576,
        -896
      ],
      "id": "f166e9af-ba05-48f5-b6df-445c162e624a",
      "name": "Delivery Note"
    },
